<LanguageData>
  
  <!-- EN: vivi refugees -->
  <VV_ViviRefugeeStart.label>薇薇难民</VV_ViviRefugeeStart.label>
  <!-- EN: Your nest was destroyed by titanic hornet swarms. The surviving Vivis scattered, and your small group of refugees escaped with minimal supplies.\n\nFortunately, you managed to evade pursuit, but the future looks grim for your group as it lacks a Royal Vivi. Can the Vivis rebuild their nest? -->
  <VV_ViviRefugeeStart.description>你所在的蜂巢被成群的巨型黄蜂摧毁了。幸存的薇薇们四散而逃，你跟着一小群难民带着极少的物资逃走了。\n\n幸运的是，你成功地逃脱了黄蜂追捕，但由于缺少皇家薇薇，蜂群的未来看起来很不容乐观。薇薇们能重建她们的蜂巢吗？</VV_ViviRefugeeStart.description>
  <!-- EN: Your nest was destroyed by titanic hornet swarms. The surviving Vivis scattered, and your small group of refugees escaped with minimal supplies.\n\nFortunately, you managed to evade pursuit, but the future looks grim for your group as it lacks a Royal Vivi. Can the Vivis rebuild their nest? -->
  <VV_ViviRefugeeStart.scenario.description>你所在的蜂巢被成群的巨型黄蜂摧毁了。幸存的薇薇们四散而逃，你跟着一小群难民带着极少的物资逃走了。\n\n幸运的是，你成功地逃脱了黄蜂追捕，但由于缺少皇家薇薇，蜂群的未来看起来很不容乐观。薇薇们能重建她们的蜂巢吗？</VV_ViviRefugeeStart.scenario.description>
  <!-- EN: vivi refugees -->
  <VV_ViviRefugeeStart.scenario.name>薇薇难民</VV_ViviRefugeeStart.scenario.name>
  <!-- EN: Your group of Vivi refugees, led by you, has confirmed that the pursuers are no longer following and has decided to stay here.\n\nSince the lifespan of regular Vivis is short and they cannot reproduce, you must raise a new Royal Vivi. Hatch Vivi eggs and feed them royal jelly to grow a new Royal Vivi, or recruit another Royal Vivi from outside. -->
  <VV_ViviRefugeeStart.scenario.parts.GameStartDialog.text>你领导的薇薇难民们已经确定黄蜂不再追捕你们，你们决定留在这里。\n\n由于普通薇薇的寿命很短且无法繁殖，你必须培养一只新的皇家薇薇。孵化薇薇蜂卵，喂它们蜂王浆，培育一只新的皇家薇薇，或者从外面招募一只皇家薇薇。</VV_ViviRefugeeStart.scenario.parts.GameStartDialog.text>
  <!-- EN: adult vivi -->
  <VV_ViviRefugeeStart.scenario.parts.ConfigurePawnsXenotypes.xenotypeCounts.0.description>成年薇薇</VV_ViviRefugeeStart.scenario.parts.ConfigurePawnsXenotypes.xenotypeCounts.0.description>
  <!-- EN: A well-armed group of Vivi refugees. -->
  <VV_ViviRefugeeStart.scenario.summary>一窝全副武装的薇薇难民。</VV_ViviRefugeeStart.scenario.summary>
  
</LanguageData>